{"channelId":"UCUF7nRA9aoievOKXh-VoiYg","row":["Lucky 13 Rescue, a KC Foster-Home Based Dog Rescue",222,"Lucky 13 Rescue is a federal 501(c)3 organization dedicated to the rescue and aid of homeless and neglected dogs in the Kansas City metro and surrounding rural areas. We do not limit our efforts to a specific breed, but rather strive to assist any dog that is facing neglect, homelessness, abuse or death. Our ultimate goal is to rehabilitate each canine in our care through placement in loving foster homes until they can be carefully matched with adoptive families.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUF7nRA9aoievOKXh-VoiYg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUF7nRA9aoievOKXh-VoiYg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:49.157Z","channelId":"UCUF7nRA9aoievOKXh-VoiYg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f4257f17667dffb0eb8eff905ea86794fde2fde53c8e7bec734d14cfd41ecf43","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"32b677e6a4aea1b181f1ca279a8ae753cda0f7f9e86bf0ab0e6b3be91b8f5a87"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUF7nRA9aoievOKXh-VoiYg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":222,"raw":"222 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUF7nRA9aoievOKXh-VoiYg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:49.157Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"Lucky 13 Rescue is a federal 501(c)3 organization dedicated to the rescue and aid of homeless and neglected dogs in the Kansas City metro and surrounding rural areas. We do not limit our efforts to a specific breed, but rather st